meta {
  name: What Ink sees beside a piece
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/pieces/{{pieceId}}/related
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  Three lists: related, forgotten and loose, each note with its own opening lines, title and dates, and looked (false while the page is too short to compare). Only your own pieces. Close means close in meaning: related needs 0.45, forgotten and loose need 0.53, so any list can be empty. Pieces without a vector yet fall back to sharing words. Needs pieceId to be a piece of yours that has words.
}
